\id 1PE  
\h 1 Peter 
\toc1 Peter Lekha Thot Khatna 
\toc2 1 Peter 
\toc3 1 Pet 
\mt1 PETER  
\mt2 PETER LEKHA THOT KHATNA  
\is1 Hahsat na ahunglhun leh ipi iti ding  
\is1 Nangma lengcha nahi! Hiti chun lunglhah bol hih in!  
\is1 1 Peter lekhabu sung thu umdan  
\ip Hahsatna ahunglhun teng ipia kinepna naneiji em? Hahsatnan naphah tengleh hoiya chu thahatna nakimuji em? Hahsat nan nahin chup teng ipin tahsan na'a na khantou sah theiyem? Pakai Yeshua jal'a chu nangma Pathena nahitai. Pathen deilhen, thempu, namtheng chule Pathena chu nahi ahitai \xt 1 Pet 2:9\xt*. Chuti ahileh hahsatnan nahin phahteng ikati ding hitam, tia nalung dong em? Pathen in hahsatna ho chu nangma hatsahna dinga amanchah theile, amanchah ji ahi. Tahsan hi hahsat thoh'a kisuthenga Pakai muchet theina le Ama hetbe chehna neitheina ahi. Hinlah Peter in hiche aseiya hi angah jeng ahipoi. Hahsatna thohpum'a Pakaiya dinga kilomtah ihinauva, midang chu Pathen phatna vetsah ding ahi, ajeh chu Aman muthim thaneina'a kon avah loupitah-a eipuilut'u ahitai \xt 1 Pet 2:9\xt*.  
\is1 Lekhathot jihpa, ajih kum chule ajih lona ajeh  
\ip Hiche lekhathot hi Pakai Yeshua seijui somle ni lah'a apipu pen, Peter hin AD 63 kum don'a chu anajih ahi. Chule Peter hin Rome khopia kon'a tahsan chate kithecheh ho Asia Minor gamkai, tua Turkey tia kihe, mun'a umho henga athot ahi. Christian hahsatna toh'a gimbol hesohna thoh ho, Pathen in einungsun hitam? tia lungdong ho tilkhouna'a ajih ahi. Aman gimhesoh thohna jenga jong kinepna hinkho aman diu leh hinlona jeh akimudoh diu deisahpeh jeh-a amaho tilkhouna'a ajih ahi.  
\is1 Pathen tohgon thusim umdan  
\ip Apatna lam'a Rome solkal hin Judate le Christian hohi hou chamlhatna anapeh gel ahiuve. Hinlah Judate le Christian kikah a kitomona ahung umbe cheh cheh phat in, Christian ho hetkhelna ahinnei pan kit tauve. Ijeh iham itileh gamsunga kitomona hin Rome solkal dingin lenggam nom'a kivaipohna asuboiye atiu ahi. Hiti chun Christian chonna hohin midangto kibahlouna asodoh e, ti jeh in dangdatna, engbolna, matna chule anei agouhou lahpehna geiyin ahin bolse tauve. Mi phabep chu atahsan nauva alung linglau tauvin, Peter jeng jong chu avoh uva chule atahsan thudol-a songkul'a khum anahitai. Hijeh chun Peter hin thohhahsa thohpum'a tahsan le kinepna neija hin ding ahi, tithua tilkhouna'a ajih ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Salam thu  
\p
\v 1 Hiche lekhathot hi Yeshua Christa solchah Peter a kon ahi. Keiman Pathen lhendoh mite gamchom mi dinmun a, Pontus, Galatia, Cappadocia, Asia chule Bithynia gamkai hoa cheng ho henga kajih ahi.  
\v 2 Pa Pathen in nanahet uva chule masang peh a nalhendoh uva, chule a Lhagaovin nasuhtheng u ahitai. Hichea kona chu nanghon asei na ngaiyuva chule Yeshua Christa thisan a nasop thengu ahitai. Pathen in lungsetna le cham-lungmon napeh be be jengtau hen.   
\s1 Kinepna hing jing  
\p
\v 3 I-Pakaiyu Yeshua Christa Pa Pathen ah vahchoina jouse umjing tahen. Ama milungsetna let jeh'a eiho pengthah a ihiu hi Pathen in Yeshua Christa chu athilah a kona akai thou jal jeh ahi.  
\v 4 Chule eihon gou simjou lou loding ineiyui-gouchan ding chu vana nangho dinga kikoiya ahi.  
\v 5 Chule natahsan jaluva chu, Pathen in athahat'a hiche huhhingna hi nakisan kahseuva na honbit uva, mi jousen amutheina dinguva ni nununga hung kilang ding ahi.  
\v 6 Hijehchun kipah tahbeh un. Nanghon phat chomkhat a dinga patepna hahsa tampi nathoh dingu ahivangin, kipana kidangtah namasanguvah aume.  
\v 7 Hiche patepna ho hin natahsanu chu akicheh monge ti avetsah ding ahi. Meiyin apatep banga natahsan u chu patep'a uma ahin chule sana maimai sanga natahsan nau mantamjo ahivanga, sana kilhantheng banga natahsan u chu kipatep'ah ahi. Hijeh a chu natahsan u chun patepna tintang ato jouva hattah a aum den a ahileh, Yeshua Christa chu vannoi pumpia akiphondoh teng chuleh nangho dinga vahchoina le loupina chule jabolna tamtah ahin lhutding ahitai.  
\v 8 Ama namu khah louvang uvin nangailu uve. Tuhin Ama namu loulai vanguvin, Ama natahsan tauve; chule nangho kipana loupitah phondoh theihoi hilou chun nakipah tauve.  
\v 9 Ama natahsan jeh uva ahung sohdoh chu na lhagaovu huhhing channa ahung hitai.  
\v 10 Hiche huhhingna thudol, lungset man'a huhhingna nangho dinga kigong chu ahi, themgao hon gaova anasei laiyuva ahetchet nom'u chu.  
\v 11 Amahon itih phat a ahilouleh itih a asunguva um Christa Lhagao chun Christa gimthohna le khonunga Aloupina kidangtah thudol chu akihou piuva, anaseipeh masah u ham ti chu adatmo uvin ahi.  
\v 12 Amaho chu athupohhou amahoa dinga hilouvin, nanghoa ding joh ahi ti seipeh anahiuve. Chule hiche Kipana Thuphahi nangho koma Vana kona Lhagao Theng thahatna'a seiphonga pang ho chun ahin phondoh u ahitai. Hiche hi akidanna kit chu vantil tenjong lung gutten a hicheho hi avetvet'u ahi.   
\s1 Hinkho thenga hinna dinga kouna  
\p
\v 13 Hijeh chun, phatechan gelun chule kitim themun. Yeshua chu vannoiya ahung kilah tengleh nachunguva lungsetna huhhingna hung lhung ding chu galdot un.  
\v 14 Hiti chun, Pathen thua nungte bangin hinkho mangun. Nalung ngaichat u suhbulhitna dingin masang nahin khouva chun kinungtol kit hih un. Chupet a chu aphajo ding nahet loulaiyu ahi.  
\v 15 Hinlah tun, Pathen nadei lhenpau athen tobanga chu nangho jong imalam jousea nathen dingu ahi.  
\v 16 Ajeh chu Pathen Thubun, “Keima kathen jeh hin nangho jong thengun,” ati.\x + \xo 1:16 \xt Thempu Dan 11:44,45; 19:2\x*  
\v 17 Chule geldoh uvin, natao nau Vana Pa chun koima lungset tum aneipoi. Aman natoh dung juiyuva nachung thu'u atan ding ahilouleh kipaman napeh dingu ahi. Hitia hi gamsunga kholjin nahi nauva hi Ama jana neiya nagin lhungkei dingu ahi.  
\v 18 Ajeh chu nanghon nahe tauve, Pathen in napu napa teuva kona kiloson hinkho panna beiya kona hi lhatdohna man apeh ahitai. Chule hiche lhatna man apeh chu sana ahilouleh dangka thila ahipoi.  
\v 19 Chonset bei, nolnabei Pathen kelngoinou, Christa thisan manlutah a chu kilhat nahiuve.  
\v 20 Pathen in ama chu vannoi kiphudoh masangpeh a nalhat diuva alhendoh chu, hiche ninununga hi Ama hung kiphongdoh a ahitai.  
\v 21 Christa jal'a Pathen nahin tahsanu ahitai. Chule nanghon Pathena natahsan u le nakinep nau chu nangap det'u ahitai, ajeh chu Aman Christa chu thinaa konin akaithouvin chule loupina lentah chu napetauve.  
\v 22 Nangho thutah thua nanun phat uva nachonset nauva kona thenga nahi tauve, hijeh a chu tua hi nangho sopi hina a nangho ngailutna dihtah chu nakineito diu ahitai. Nalung gil pum piuvin khat le khat kingailu touvin.  
\v 23 Ajeh chu nangho penthahna hi abeiloi ding tuhinkhoa ahipoi. Hinna thah naneiyu hi aitih a umjing ding ahi, ajeh chu hichu Pathen Thuhing jing tonsot'a um jinga kon ahi.  
\v 24 Pathen Thubun asei dung juiyin, “Mihemte hi hampa tobangbep ahi, ahoinau jong loujaova pahcha pah tobangbep ahi. Hampa agopjin chule apah chu amolloiji.\x + \xo 1:24 \xt Isa 40:6-8\x*  
\v 25 Hinlah Pakai Thu chu imatih chan'a umjing ding ahi.” Chule hiche thuhi Kipana Thupha nahenguva kiseiphong chu ahi.   
\c 2  
\s1 Songpi hing jing le namtheng  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun umchan phalou ho, mi lheplhahna jouse, phatlhem, mithang thipna, chule ngainom umlou thusei jouse pailhauvin.  
\v 2 Naosen sohthah ho bangin, lhagao bongnoi thengsel chu ngaichauvin chutileh lhagao huhhingna a chu na kikhanlhit thei dingu ahi.  
\v 3 Tun nanghon Pakai phatna chu natekhah u ahitai.\x + \xo 2:3 \xt Labu 34:8\x*  
\v 4 Nangho Christa, Pathen Hou-in hingjing inning songpi, henga chu hunga nahi tauve. Ama chu miho pampai ahin, ahinlah Pathen in jana lentah chang dinga alhendoh joh ahitai.  
\v 5 Chule nangho, song hingho Pathen in lhagao hou-in a dinga asahdoh chu nahiuve. Akalval ipi um'em, nangho Ama dia thempu thengho nahi tauve. Yeshua Christa Palai hina a Pathen lunglhaina theiya lhagaova kilhaina-thilto chu bol'ah nahi tauve.  
\v 6 Pathen Thubun asei dung juiyin, “Keiman Jerusalema inning songpi kakoiyin, jabolna lentah dinga kilheng dohsa ahi, chule koi hileh Ama tahsan chan chu lungsetna changlouva umloubeh ding ahi,” ati.\x + \xo 2:6 \xt Isa 28:16\x*  
\v 7 Tahbeh in, nangho Ama tahsan hon Pathen in apeh jabolna chu nahetpeh un. Hinlah Ama pampai ho din “insahon adeimouva apampaiyu song chu tun inning sonpin apangtai.”\x + \xo 2:7 \xt Labu 118:22\x*  
\v 8 Chule “Ama miho kipalsah chu ahin, chule amaho lhuhna songpi chu ahitai.” Amaho akipalnau ajeh chu amaho Pathen Thun anung pouve, chule amaho dinga kigong achandiu chu akimu tauve.\x + \xo 2:8 \xt Isa 8:14,15\x*  
\v 9 Ahin nangho hitobang chu nahi lou u ahi, ajeh chu nangho lhen tum mite nahiuve. Nangho leng-thempu ho, namtheng, Pathen nei chu nahi tauve. Hijeh a chu, nanghon midang ho Pathen phatna chu navetsah theiju ahitai, ajeh chu Aman muthim lah a kona avah loupi kidangtah a chu napuilut u ahitai.\x + \xo 2:9 \xt Potdohbu 19:5,6; Isa 43:20; \xt Potdohbu 19:5; Danbu Ni Na 4:20; 7:6; 14:2; Tit 2:14; \xt Isa 43:21; \xt Isa 9:2\x*  
\v 10 “Masanga chu amite hina photchenna neilou nahiu ahin, tua hi nangho Pathen mite nahiu ahitai. Masanga chu khotona anachanglou nahiu ahin, tua hi Pathen khotona chu changa nahi tauve.”\x + \xo 2:10 \xt Hosea 2:23\x*   
\p
\v 11 Deitahte, “chomkhat a dinga khosa chule gamchom mi” nahiu toh kilhon'a kagihsal nahiuve, nangho nalhagaovu douva pang vannoi lung ngaichat hoa konin kikang seuvin.  
\v 12 Naheng nakom atahsanlou to cheng khom nahiu chu heuvin lang, chingtheiyun. Chujouleh amahon thildihlou bol a themmo nachan ujongleh ja theiya naum nau chu mudoh uvintin, chule Aman vannoi thu atan teng Pathen chu jana apeh dingu ahi.  
\v 13 Pakai jal'in, mihem thuneina jouse jabol un, Lengpa chu gamneipa ahinaa jading ahi,  
\v 14 ahilouleh thunei aman alhendoh hijongleh jana pen. Ajeh chu lengpa chun thildihlou bolho gimbol dinga chule thilpha bolho jabolna pedinga amaho chu ngansena apeh ahi.  
\v 15 Ja umtah'a hinkho naman diu chu Pathen lunglam ahi, hichun alamlouva ngolhoitah a themmo nahin chanhou chu asuhthip ding ahi.  
\v 16 Ajeh chu nangho chamlhat nahiu ahi, hinlah nangho Pathen sohte nahiuve, hiti ahijeh chun nachamlhatnau chu thilse bolnan neihih un.  
\v 17 Amitakip jabolun, chule Christian nasopi chu ngailun. Pathen gingin, chule lengpa chu jabol in.   
\s1 Soh ho  
\p
\v 18 Chule nangho sohho naputeu thuneina chu jana neitoh thon sanguvin. Amahon bol'un tia nahilu chu bolun-amaho chu mihepithem le lunggel toh them ahiseh-u hilouvin, mi engse ahiu jongleh bolun.  
\v 19 Ajeh chu Pathen lunglhaina chu nanghon adih ahi ti nahet'u chu naboluva chule alamlouva nakibol nauva jong thohhattah a napan dingu ahi.  
\v 20 Ahinai, thilse boljeh a nathoh hatnau chun ima chanding nanei pouve. Hinlah thilphabol jeh a gimbolna nathoh uva thohhattah a napanuva ahileh, Pathen nachunguva lunglhaiyah ahi.  
\v 21 Ajeh chu Pathen in Christan nangho dinga gimbol hesoh athoh banga chu gimthohna ding hijongleh thilpha boldinga nakouvu ahi. Ama navettoh uva najui dingu chule akhonung najui dingu ahiye.  
\v 22 Ama achonse khapoi, koima cha jong alhemlha khapoi.\x + \xo 2:22 \xt Isa 53:9\x*  
\v 23 Ama ajumsou jong chun alethuhpoi, agimhesoh thoh pet in jong akithuhpoi. Aman achungchang thu adihtah a thutan jing Pathen khut a angam lhan ahi.\x + \xo 2:23 \xt Isa 53:7\x*  
\v 24 Amatah in atahsa chunga ichonsetna hou thingpel chunga chun apoi, hichu eiho chonsetna lama ithiuva chule chonphatna lama ihin theina dingu ahi. Ama kijepna mahahoa chu nanghon damna namu u ahi.\x + \xo 2:24 \xt Isa 53:5,6\x*  
\v 25 Nangho masanga chu avah manga nana hiu ahin, hinlah tun na Chingpau, na lhagaovu Kaihoipa henga chu hung kilekit'ah nahi tauve.   
\c 3  
\s1 Nupa kah a pasal le numei chonnadol  
\p
\v 1 Chutima chun, nangho ji numei hon napasalteu thuneina chu kisan uvin. Chutengleh, amaho lah a Kipana Thupha joplou aum tah jongleh, thuchenga seilouva na Pathen ngaisahnau navetsah uchun thu aseijoh ding ahi. Amaho nathujona ding uchu,\x + \xo 3:1 \xt Eph 5:22; Col 3:18\x*  
\v 2 Nanghon thenna le jana hinkho naman'u amuuva kon hiding ahi.  
\v 3 Polam hoina khohsahnan sampheh a kijep hoi, thil mantam sana khi-o ahilouleh ponsil hoi hoa kijem ding gelkhoh hih un.\x + \xo 3:3 \xt 1 Tim 2:9\x*  
\v 4 Nangho sunggila kona hoina, chultheilou lungneng le thip khen cha um, hichea chu nakijep joh dingu ahi, hichu Pathena dinga manlutah ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche hi malai numei theng masa ho amaho tah akijep hoinau chu anahi. Amahon Pathen atahsanun chule ajipateu thuneina chu anakisan u ahi.  
\v 6 Avetsahnan, Sarah chu ajipa Abraham, thun anungin, chule ajipa chu ka-pakai tin akouve. Najipa teuvin ipi ahinbol dingu kichatna neilou hel'a nanghon thilpha chu naboluva ahileh ama chanute nahiu ahi.\x + \xo 3:6 \xt Semtilbu 18:12\x*  
\v 7 Hitobangma chun, pasal nanghon najinu teu jabolun. Nijinu teu chuto umkhom'a nahiu toh kilhon in hetkhen themna neijin bolun. Ama nangho sanga thalhomjo hitheinante, hinlah Pathen in hinkho thah a hinkho naman khompi dinga napeh-u chu ahi. Nataonau adal louna dingin amaho chu nabolna dingdola chun bolin.\x + \xo 3:7 \xt Eph 5:25; Col 3:19\x*   
\s1 Adih'a genthei hesoh thoh  
\p
\v 8 Achainakeiyin, nangho jouse lungkhat kisauvin. Khatle khat kigelkhohto uvin. Sopi hina in kingailu touvin. Lungneng unlang chule kineosah cheh un.  
\v 9 Setna chu asen lethuh hih un. Mihon najumso tenguleh jumso kitna ding lunggel hih un. Hisang chun phattheiboh jouvin. Hichu Pathen in nabol dinga nakouna chu ahi, chule Aman hiche jal a chu phatthei naboh ding ahi.  
\v 10 Ajehchu, Pathen Thubun asei chu, “Nangman hinkho chu nakipapia, nikho kipa um tampi namu noma ahileh, naleigui chu thilse seinaa konin kihuh tup in, thilpha bolin chule namuh chu jou seina a konin kikangsen.\x + \xo 3:10 \xt Labu 34:12-16\x*  
\v 11 Thil phalouva konin kiheimangin, chule thilpha chu bol in.  
\v 12 Thildih bolho chu Pakaiyin ntin a avetsui ahi, chule ataonau ngaina in anakol asung jinge. Hinlah Pakai chun thilse bol ho dounaa amai angat jing ahi.”  
\v 13 Tun, nanghon thilpha nabol nomuva ahileh koiham nasugim dinguva?  
\v 14 \x + \xo 3:14 \xt Isa 8:12,13\x*Thildih boljeh a hahsatna nato tah uva ahijongleh, Pathen in hichea chu nale thuhding ahi. Hijehchun, amaho gihsal jeh chun lung himo ahilouleh kichat bol hih un.\x + \xo 3:14 \xt Matt 5:10\x*  
\v 15 Chusanga nangman Christa chu nahinkhoa Pakaiya nanei ding hiya ahi. Chule koiham khat'in na-Christian hina anakinepna thudol chu nadoh a ahileh hilchenin.  
\v 16 Hinlah hiche hi lungneng le jatheiyin bolin. Selepha nahetna chu thengin koiyin. Chua chu mihon nangho douna a thu aseiyuva ahileh amahon Christa a nahijeh uva hinkho phatah naman chu amu tenguleh jahcha dingu ahi.  
\v 17 Geldoh in, thilphalou boljeh a gimthoh sanga chu, thilpha bol jeh a gimthoh chu Pathen deilam ahijoi.  
\v 18 Christa chun a-itih a dinga khatvei athohgim ahi. Ama achonse khapoi, hinlah ama Pathen kom a chu bit keicha lhun theina dinga chonseho jeh a thia ahi. Aman tahsa tah a thina ato ahin, hinlah Ama Lhagaova kaithouva uma hingdoh kit ahi.  
\v 19 Hiti chun, Ama gachea lhagao songkul'a kihenho koma aga seiphong ahitai.  
\v 20 Amaho hi masanglai peh a Noah chun kong anasui laiya Pathen in thoh hattah'a anga laiya Pathen thua nung louva ahiuve. Hiche tijat umtah twisanglet'a lhah lhumna dinga kona chu mi get bou sohchaa ahiuve.\x + \xo 3:20 \xt Semtilbu 6:1—7:24\x*  
\v 21 Chule hiche twi chu baptize chan vetsahna ahi, hichun tua hi nahuhhingu ahi, tipuma anen pailhahna hilouva, Pathen lama selepha hetna kichehna ding ahi. Yeshua Christa thodoh kit jal a hichun na atoh ahiye.  
\v 22 Tun Christa chu van'a gachea ahitan, Ama Pathen bantah a jabol channa muna touva ahitai, chule Vantilte le athuneiho chule thaneiho jousen Ama thuneina asangun ahi.   
\c 4  
\s1 Pathen adia hin ding  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chu ahin, Christa chun tahsaa athoh gim tah jeh in, Ama a um lungput chu nanghon jong naneiyu angaiye, chule gimthoh dingin kigosan umun. Ajeh chu nanghon Christa jal a tahsa lama gim hesoh nathoh uva ahileh chonset chu najou tauve.  
\v 2 Nanghon nahinkhou aum chengse chu nangma ho lung ngaichatlam chu holtalouva, Pathen lunglam joh chu bol nomna nanei dingu ahitai.  
\v 3 Nang hon chidang namdang nahilai uva chu Pathen ngaisahlouna lunggotlam nathanopnau, chonhoilou le tahsa lung ngaichat, kinopvahna le jukhamna chule motchon tothoa lamna, chule milim houna'a tijat jat um nanabol u chu aphaset ahitai.  
\v 4 Amahon setna chu twisoh banga motchon le man thahna thei thil ho aboluva chu nathanoppi tahloujeh uva chu nana kivoppi hou chun adat mouva hitia chu naseiset u ahibouve.  
\v 5 Hinlah geldoh un, amahon amitakip ahing le athiho chung thutan ding Pathen chu akimutopi diu ahi.  
\v 6 Hijeh a chu Kipana Thupha thu chu tua athiho henga kiseiphonga ahitai-hichu amaho midang jouse banga athi diu gonchaisa ahiuvin, tua hi amaho Pathen toa-i-tih a dinga lhagaova hing jing dinga gonsa ahitauve.  
\v 7 Vannoi kichaina ding phat hung lhung pai ding ahitai. Hiti ahijeh chun lungdih tah pun chule tao jingna dingin limgeh chan umun.  
\v 8 Athupi penin, khat le khat kingailutna nangho khat in khat chunga neiyuvin, ajeh chu ngailut hin chonset tamtah akhun ahi.\x + \xo 4:8 \xt Thuchihbu 10:12\x*  
\v 9 Nehding ngaicha ahilouleh umna ding hol a chu kipahtah in na-in'a lhunsah un.  
\v 10 Pathen in nangho khat chang cheh hi lhagao thilpeh ho napeh cheh u ahi. Hichu khat le khat kijen nan mangun.  
\v 11 Thusei theina lhagao thilpeh nakipe em? Chuti ahileh Pathen in nang koma thu asei bangtah in seijin. Midang kithopina thilpeh nachan em? Pathen in thahat le thaneina napeh chu panin bol'in. Chutileh nabol jouse chu Yeshua Christa jal in Pathen loupina hung hitheiyinte. Aimatih chanin loupina le thaneina jouse chu Ama a hi jing hen! Amen.   
\s1 Christian hijeh'a hesoh genthei thoh  
\p
\v 12 Deitah teho, nanghon patepna meikou banga hahsa nathoh u chu, thil nahet khahlou hel'u nato'u tobang'in datmo hih un.  
\v 13 Chusangin hapan kipah jouvin–ijeh inem itileh nanghon Christan athoh gimna a chu chan neikhoma nahiuve, hitia chu Aloupina kipana kidangtah chu vannoi pumpia akiphondoh tengleh nanghon namuva nanei dingu ahi.  
\v 14 Hiti ahijeh chun Christian nahi jeh uva najachatsah tengu jongleh kipah un, ajeh chu loupina Pathen lhagao chu nachunguva uma ahi.  
\v 15 Hinama jongleh nathoh gimnau chu tolthat hijeh, guhchat jeh, setboljeh, ahilouva ahileh midang chunga kikum jeh hida hen.  
\v 16 Ahin Christian hijeh a thohgim chu jachatna ding ahipoi. Amina kikou nahi jal in Pathen chu vahchoiyin!  
\v 17 Ajeh chu thutanna phat hung lhunga ahitai, chule Pathen insung pumpia kipan ding ahi. Chule thutanna chu eihoa akipat a ahileh, Pathen Kipana Thupha joplou ho chan ding chu iti tijat um hiding hitam?  
\v 18 Chukit jongleh, “Mi dih chu huhhing ahahsatleh, Pathen ngaisahlou chonseho ititauvin tem?”\x + \xo 4:18 \xt Thuchihbu 11:31\x*  
\v 19 Hitia chu Pathen lunglhaina a gim nathoh uva ahileh, adih chu boljom jingun, chule nahinkhou chu nasempau Pathena ngamlhauvin, ajeh chu Aman itinama jongleh nalha kanglou dingu ahi.   
\c 5  
\s1 Upa holeh khangdong ho henga tepna  
\p
\v 1 Chule tun, houbung hoa Upa ho henga, keima jong Upa khat hina a Christa gimthohna a chan kachan khompi hina a kathumop nom nahiuve. Chule, keima jong, Ama loupina a chu vannoiya ahung kilah teng chuleh aloupina chu chang khom ding kahi. Upat nachan khompiu keiman nahenguva kahin ngeh nahiuve:  
\v 2 Pathen in chin dinga nanganseu kelngoi hon chengse chu chingun. Lungcham tah in, lunghimo louhelin bolun-nanghon ipi phatchomna kakimudoh theidem ti hilouvin, Pathen na natoh nom joh jeh uvin bol jouvin.\x + \xo 5:2 \xt Jn 21:15-17\x*  
\v 3 Na kinganse hou chunga kipiputsahna bol louvin, na umchanhoi chu vetsah in puihoi jouvin.  
\v 4 Chule Kelngoi ching pipu ahung kilah teng chuleh, nanghon aitih a abeitih umlou loupina le jabolna Lallukhuh chu nachan dingu ahi.  
\v 5 Hitobangma chun, nangho khangdong hon jong Upa vaihom ho thuneina chu noppeh un. Chule nangho nabonchauvin, khat in khat kineosah pumin jenun, ajeh chu “Pathen in akiletsah chu adouvin, akineosah mi vang chu alung lhaina ahi.”\x + \xo 5:5 \xt Thuchihbu 3:34\x*  
\v 6 Hiti chun nangho Pathen thahattah thaneina noiya umun chule aman aphatcha jabolna tohthoa nachoisang dingu ahi.\x + \xo 5:6 \xt Matt 23:12; Lk 14:11; 18:14\x*  
\v 7 Nalung khamnahou le nagelkhoh hou chu Pathena peuvin, ijeh inem itileh aman nachung chang thu nagelkhoh pehnai.  
\v 8 Kichih theiyuvin! Namelmau pipu, Diabol jeh chun kihong phauvin. Ama keipi bahkai kitum tobang'in vallhum ding mi ahol in ahi.  
\v 9 Ama dounaa dingdet un, chule natahsan nauva chun hat'un. Vannoi pumpia nasopiu Christian ho chu nangho banga thohgimna atocheh u ahi.  
\v 10 Pathen in amikhoto themna Christa Yeshua jal a tonsot aloupina chu chang dinga nakouvu ahitai.  
\v 11 Amaa thaneina chu tonsot tonsotin hijing hen! Amen.   
\s1 Salam chaina  
\p
\v 12 Tahsan umtah sopi Silas, nangho koma seiphatna kapeh, ama kithopina jal a hiche lekhathot chomcha hi nahenguva dinga kahin jih ahi. Nakomuva dinga kahin jihlona ajeh chu nanghon tua hi Pathen lungset nachan tahbeh u ahi tia tilkhouna le photchetsahnaa ding ahi. Hiche lungsetna a hin ding det un.\x + \xo 5:12 \xt Act 15:22,40\x*  
\v 13 Hikom Rome muna na-houbung chanpiu le kachapa Mark in jong chibai nahin peuve.\x + \xo 5:13 \xt Act 12:12,25; 13:13; 15:37-39; Col 4:10; Phile 1:24\x*  
\v 14 Christian kingailutna chun khat in khat chibai kibohtouvin. Christa Yeshua a umho jouse cham-lungmonna in na umpiu hen.   